	"system": {
		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p>This reinforced gourd is suitable both for use as a handheld musical instrument and for bashing heads should a crowd turn sour. This adds its item bonus from weapon potency runes (if any) as an item bonus on Performance checks made while using it as an instrument.</p><hr><p><strong>Activate—Huli-Po, the Echoing Gourd</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (interact)</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> once</p><hr><p><strong>Effect</strong> When unsealed, Huli-Po releases a celestial song that has the effects of an 8th rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.qlxM7Ik3uUeUIOcv]{Canticle of Everlasting Grief} spell (@Damage[10d6[menta]]) with @Check[will|dc:41|basic|traits:mental,auditory,curse,fear,manipulate,emotion] and this item permanently dissipates into mist.</p>"
